ms hotel  she had no problem wearing the pajamas  and she put the rollers in her hair so  a good sport is what i'm trying to say  and just a a great lady  i had talked to her last week she had  called me to say frank she's like what  is your address i sent you a christmas  gift i got it back three times  what am i doing wrong and she just had a  misspelling but as we were talking i  said let's go to lunch one day she goes  all right i just want to wait for coco  to get over with and we'll do that she  goes and i'm going through a few  doctor's appointments and i said  all right one of those she goes i can't  get until the end of february and i was  like you're mary wilson  you know what do you mean you can't get  in so we were talking doctors and i gave  her my concierge doctor i said this guy  could get you in an hour  it's a special service blah blah blah so  i i talked to him about her coming over  and the whole thing set up  yesterday at the blue i just was going  to text and say hey jimmy talk to the  doctor  didn't hear back went to the mail i got  this beautiful gift in the mail from her  but the christmas card came with this  lovely gift  very strange it's called uh time to move  on  very eerie so then later in the day  we were just about to say thank you in a  text and it popped up mary wilson had  passed and my heart stopped it was like  midnight  and it i'm still in shock i gotta say it  but when it hits it's gonna it's gonna  be bad because we were really really  close and  the world's gonna miss a really great  supreme lady
 

